{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The quiet town of Frozen Pines. It was the perfect place to get away, just the two of you. So then why? Why did things go so horribly wrong? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware, you're being hunted. Strange and deadly monstrosities hide behind every corner. Armed with only an axe and your wits, face the horrors and find the answers you seek.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/2025-05-2920-38-10-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749246941\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Directional, Grid-Based Combat -</strong>\u00a0Brutal grid-based combat with directional attacking and blocking that requires both quick reflexes and strategic thinking. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices\u00a0Matter\u00a0-\u00a0</strong>Be careful on you route through  Frozen Pines, your actions will affect will affect whether characters live or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Love Letter to PS2 Horror</strong> - Inspired by the likes of Killer7, King's Field 4, and the Silent Hill series, with a unique retro horror aesthetic. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chilling Monster Encounters -\u00a0</strong>Explore a variety of eerie locations and eldritch beasts as you search for survivors, uncovering the town's mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122000/extras/GIF_HungerEncounter.gif?t=1749246941\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">_____________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\">